A statue is not a tool: a figurine is. You can apply a figurine. The
only use I found so far for statues is chopping them with your
pick-axe. I believe there is a one-in-eight chance that they contain a
spellbook.

Two more remarks: if you hit a monster or person with a cockatrice
corpse (wiels some protection for your hands first, of course), they
will turn into statues that contain all things they were originally
carrying. Second, some monsters may pose as statues and attack you when
you come close.

